  <section class="cc-section cc-wrap" id="theme-notes" aria-labelledby="notes-title"><div class="cc-section-heading"><div><span class="cc-eyebrow">04 / Craft notes</span><h2 id="notes-title">A store,<br>carefully composed.</h2></div><p>An original classic theme with a separate static design preview. Catalogue behaviour depends on whether WooCommerce has visible published products.</p></div><div class="cc-notes-grid"><article class="cc-note"><span class="cc-note-number">01</span><h3>An original identity</h3><p>Cream, forest and terracotta. A geometric mark, editorial type and original vector illustrations form one visual system. System fonts and local assets keep it self-contained.</p></article><article class="cc-note"><span class="cc-note-number">02</span><h3>Designed for the screen</h3><p>The catalogue moves from three columns to two, then one. Native product disclosures, visible focus states, a skip link and reduced-motion support make the small interactions deliberate.</p></article><article class="cc-note"><span class="cc-note-number">03</span><h3>Built for WordPress</h3><p>The classic theme supports custom logos, navigation menus, page content and an optional WooCommerce catalogue. Dynamic product text, URLs and permitted HTML have distinct escaping paths.</p></article></div><div class="cc-preview-status"><span class="cc-status-mark" aria-hidden="true">i</span><p><strong><?php echo esc_html($is_sample ? __('Sample catalogue mode', 'commerce-canvas') : __('WooCommerce catalogue mode', 'commerce-canvas')); ?></strong><?php echo esc_html($is_sample ? __('The theme is showing bundled fictional fixtures. No checkout or payment action is supplied by this sample homepage.', 'commerce-canvas') : __('This homepage presents visible products and links to their WooCommerce pages. Cart, checkout, taxes, shipping and payment gateways remain WooCommerce and merchant configuration responsibilities.', 'commerce-canvas')); ?></p></div></section>
